1
00:00:00,073 --> 00:00:02,420
At midnight, men turn into women…

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,327
…and women turn into men.

3
00:00:04,693 --> 00:00:08,800
WHAT IF EVERYTHING FLIPPED?!

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,800
The rules flip too. But everyone remembers the old world.

5
00:00:08,877 --> 00:00:11,100
Alex still remembers the old world.

6
00:00:09,183 --> 00:00:11,177
NEW BODY.

7
00:00:11,253 --> 00:00:13,937
Ads flipped: pink is now for boys.

8
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:16,773
Even this ad changed: cleaning is his job.

9
00:00:16,927 --> 00:00:19,917
Every part of life gets new rules.

10
00:00:17,847 --> 00:00:19,993
NEW BODY. NEW SOCIAL RULES.

11
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:22,600
Maya gets the old women's rules now.

12
00:00:22,747 --> 00:00:26,120
Alex's old clothes don't fit the new body.

13
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:29,860
Now women get the old men's rules. The list never ends.

14
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:33,013
Alex swipes it away. It comes back.

15
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:36,717
Maya gets the old women's rules… and deletes them.

16
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,900
WHO INVENTED THESE RULES?!

17
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,067
At home, the jobs swapped too.

18
00:00:40,133 --> 00:00:43,233
He must do the housework. She must earn the money.

19
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,833
The work is the same. Only who does it changed.

20
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:50,900
DIFFERENT EXPECTATIONS. SAME AMOUNT OF WORK.

21
00:00:50,977 --> 00:00:52,817
At work, posters changed overnight.

22
00:00:52,893 --> 00:00:55,040
Before: for women. Now: for men.

23
00:00:55,193 --> 00:00:58,758
Alex must now act like the boss: no doubts, no 'sorry'.

24
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:01,250
Maya must now be soft and smile.

25
00:01:02,477 --> 00:01:04,700
Her ID photo shows the old her.

26
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:08,150
THE WORLD FLIPPED. THE DEADLINE DIDN'T.

27
00:01:08,833 --> 00:01:11,833
The dating app keeps flipping who should pay.

28
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:14,833
Every answer keeps switching.

29
00:01:15,333 --> 00:01:16,900
NEW RULES?

30
00:01:15,567 --> 00:01:19,167
So they close the app and split the bill.

31
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:21,167
NEW RULES? OR NO RULES?

32
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:23,399
They watch a sad movie.

33
00:01:23,471 --> 00:01:26,927
New rule: women don't cry. So Alex is 'too emotional'.

34
00:01:26,927 --> 00:01:29,807
New rule: men must show feelings. Maya didn't.

35
00:01:29,807 --> 00:01:32,543
Swapping phones doesn't help. Nothing is right.

36
00:01:32,615 --> 00:01:35,207
YOU CAN'T WIN.

37
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:40,867
Nobody knows why it happened. The internet panics.

38
00:01:41,033 --> 00:01:44,800
A scientist claims to have the answer…

39
00:01:44,933 --> 00:01:48,200
…but he has no idea either.

40
00:01:45,933 --> 00:01:48,200
THE INTERNET MADE IT WORSE.

41
00:01:48,267 --> 00:01:50,467
They compare old rules and new rules.

42
00:01:50,533 --> 00:01:54,533
They are mirror images. Both are exhausting.

43
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:57,800
So they throw both rulebooks away.

44
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:02,200
MAYBE THE PROBLEM... WAS THE RULES.

45
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:02,200
(real change takes more than one click)

46
00:01:59,933 --> 00:02:02,200
Outside, people simply share the work.

47
00:02:02,267 --> 00:02:05,467
A giant button can bring back the old world.

48
00:02:05,533 --> 00:02:07,800
Alex reaches for it. Maya stops her.

49
00:02:07,867 --> 00:02:11,067
Option 2: keep the new bodies, but delete the stereotypes.

50
00:02:08,867 --> 00:02:11,200
WHICH WORLD WOULD YOU CHOOSE?

